{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <i>Rage of Towers</i>, tower defense meets real-time action. You\u2019ll defend your base from massive waves of enemies using classic tower defense strategy \u2014 but this time, you\u2019re not just watching from above. Step into the battlefield and take control.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2567680/extras/4283a102efe69b52855848cf3aa1fa40.poster.avif?t=1758806208\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2567680/extras/4283a102efe69b52855848cf3aa1fa40.webm?t=1758806208\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2567680/extras/4283a102efe69b52855848cf3aa1fa40.mp4?t=1758806208\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83e\udde0 THINK FAST. ACT FASTER.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In most tower defense games, you build and watch. In <i>Rage of Towers</i>, the battlefield is <strong>dynamic and reactive</strong> \u2014 towers aren\u2019t just static weapons, and enemies won\u2019t wait patiently in line. You\u2019ll need to adapt in real time, taking control of special towers and mobile units, redirecting fire, and executing clutch defenses to survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2567680/extras/a7f318688f86f6124c136c145303c12a.poster.avif?t=1758806208\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2567680/extras/a7f318688f86f6124c136c145303c12a.webm?t=1758806208\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2567680/extras/a7f318688f86f6124c136c145303c12a.mp4?t=1758806208\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udfae FEATURES</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udee0\ufe0f BUILD POWERFUL TOWERS</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from a wide arsenal of towers including:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Machine Guns</strong>, <strong>Artillery, Tesla, Missile Launchers, Air Strike Tower</strong> and more.</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chain tower effects together \u2014 slow + AOE, shock + burn, Drones + Tanks \u2014 to devastate incoming waves.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2567680/extras/de35947ca9f752224cfa66238797e6f0.poster.avif?t=1758806208\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2567680/extras/de35947ca9f752224cfa66238797e6f0.webm?t=1758806208\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2567680/extras/de35947ca9f752224cfa66238797e6f0.mp4?t=1758806208\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2699\ufe0f CONTROL THE BATTLEFIELD</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take direct control of <strong>mobile defense units</strong> such as drones And Tanks.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Manually operate</strong> certain high-impact towers for tactical moments (e.g., aim artillery, trigger Rockets).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reposition your mobile units in real time to react to Everything.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > FACE EVOLVING ENEMIES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Waves include a wide variety of enemies:</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tanks</strong>, <strong>Shielded Units</strong>, <strong>Air Units</strong>, and more.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each enemy type has unique strengths, Abilities, and movement behaviors.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Later stages introduce <strong>adaptive AI behavior</strong>, forcing you to constantly rethink your defense.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udf0d MULTIPLE MAPS &amp; ENVIRONMENTS</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defend in stunning, Realistic maps: 45 Stages With 45 unique Atmospheres .</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each map has unique layouts, terrain advantages, and environmental challenges.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udfaf STRATEGY + SKILL</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Success is about more than tower spam:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Smart positioning.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Real-time resource use.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Timing manual abilities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Responding to unexpected threats.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2567680/extras/b2df28fc201bf5e89180800484a2005f.poster.avif?t=1758806208\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2567680/extras/b2df28fc201bf5e89180800484a2005f.webm?t=1758806208\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2567680/extras/b2df28fc201bf5e89180800484a2005f.mp4?t=1758806208\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udd13 PROGRESSION SYSTEM</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock new towers, upgrades, and mobile units.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experiment with different tower/unit synergies to master difficult levels.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udf00 GAME MODES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Campaign Mode</strong>: Complete handcrafted levels with varied objectives and increasing complexity.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Endless Mode</strong>: Survive as long as possible against increasingly difficult waves.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udfaf WHY RAGE OF TOWERS?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you love the planning and payoff of tower defense, but crave <strong>more control, more action, and more depth</strong>, <i>Rage of Towers</i> is for you. It rewards quick thinking, strategic foresight, and clutch decision-making \u2014 all in one tightly designed package.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83e\udde8 KEY FEATURES SUMMARY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2705 Hybrid of tower defense and real-time tactical control <br>\u2705 Direct tower/unit micromanagement <br>\u2705 Dozens of towers and upgrades <br>\u2705 Unique enemy waves <br>\u2705 Multiple maps and enemy types <br>\u2705 Long Campaign, Endless <br>\u2705 Realistic visuals and dynamic battlefields </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With a wide selection of towers to place and upgrade and an array of complex strategic maps to test your defenses, even the most skilled Tower Defense players will meet a challenge in Rage Of towers. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gameplay note</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Developer's Recommended Configuration is expected to fully work from the start to the end. This includes all movements, menu, and key functions mapped to the controller.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2567680?t=1758806208","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2567680/b6f7512ff3fa4ab5f7806633549bd32e24a170